<!--
  The widgets' words that the picker shows before the app has run, so they
  cannot come from the server, and the X0 widget's fallbacks for the words its
  glance brings (the glance's `words`, the server's knobs in en and Hinglish).
-->
<resources>
    <!--
      X0 (TailzuX0Widget.kt): its picker name and description, the words it
      falls back on when the glance has none (each the contract's own,
      docs/widget-glance-v2.md in the backend: needsYou, ready, ask, brand,
      youDecide, working, step, minIn, seePr, done; and min, pr and the answer's
      states, which a glance may add), and its picker preview's sample: Code bot
      building the cart fix, step 3 of 5, while Travel bot finds a hotel.
    -->
